      type: {class: BtRoot, ns: CGD.BehaviorTrees, asm: CGD.Runtime}
      data:
        _guid: 760a8b82d927026299a416b1c03ef514
        _position: {x: 275, y: 0}
        _comment: 'Bio lying in wait in a bush: still, eyes on the target, until it walks close or turns its back (Ambush From Cover). Then it arms its Ambush (Escape slot) and springs: a short committed charge and strike. Fails if given away or the target never comes. Put it behind Is Hidden.'
